  partName: IntakeManifoldBoltLeft (2)
  description: The IntakeManifoldBoltLeft (2) is another tiny, elongated bolt located
    at the top-left-front of the engine, working alongside the IntakeManifoldBoltLeft
    to secure the intake manifold in place. Made of Material.001, this bolt is designed
    to withstand the stresses and temperatures generated by the engine's intake system.
    Interestingly, the IntakeManifoldBoltLeft (2) is positioned to provide additional
    support to the intake manifold, helping to prevent damage and vibration.
